Seems to be solved by setting addJitter=T in the called to
'RmaBackgroundCorrection' ... the NaNs get introduced in the
'bg.adjust' call so I suspect it has something to do with the
estimation in 'bg.parameters' ... but I haven't looked into it further.

Mark

