Subject: Re: [aroma.affymetrix] Making expression matrices with exon arrays
Message-ID: <cRGDQIXsz14.l23WN-9hKyEJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <cRGDQIXsz14.TprO-lkM2tQJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
