Ok,

that fix was easier than I anticipated; I've already uploaded the
patch, so just do:

library(aroma.affymetrix);
downloadPackagePatch("aroma.affymetrix");

and the patches will be downloaded and applied. They will also be
applied automagically whenever you load the package.

Yu Chuan, if you already started createMonoCell(), let it finish.
Otherwise, do the above, and continue with fit() etc and the package
should detect that the monocell CDF is missing and then create it.

/Henrik

